    "Montenegro": ["Montenegro","Europe",3,"🇲🇪","Podgorica","620K","13.8K km²","Adriatic Balkans","Montenegro","Podgorica","Bay_of_Kotor","Bay of Kotor & Durmitor Peaks","Compact 'Black Mountain' Adriatic coast nation between Croatia and Albania","Named 'Black Mountain' by Venetian sailors for the dark pine forests cloaking Mount Lovćen above the fjord-like Bay of Kotor, Montenegro packs dramatic glacial peaks, Europe's deepest river canyon (Tara Gorge), and sunny Adriatic beaches into a territory smaller than Connecticut.","Named 'Black Mountain' by Venetian mariners, this tiny Adriatic Balkan country combines the fjord-like Bay of Kotor with Europe's deepest gorge, the Tara River Canyon.",["ports"],"Mediterranean"],
