    "Mozambique": ["Mozambique","Africa",2,"🇲🇿","Maputo","34M","802K km²","Southern-East Africa","Mozambique","Maputo","Bazaruto_Archipelago","Bazaruto Coral Islands & Indian Ocean Coast","Long Indian Ocean coast nation facing Madagascar across its namesake channel","Stretching over 2,400 km along the warm Indian Ocean opposite Madagascar, Mozambique is watered by the Zambezi and Limpopo rivers and fringed by coral archipelagos like Bazaruto and the historic Swahili-Portuguese trading port of Ilha de Moçambique.","Facing Madagascar across a broad Indian Ocean channel, this Portuguese-speaking nation boasts a 2,400-km coastline where the mighty Zambezi River empties into the sea.",["ports"],"Tropical Savanna"],
